  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To believe is to create</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In marginalized communities of northeast Medelln young people have few social employment and leadership opportunities to support themselves and their families. Corporacin Proyectarte (Proyectarte) partners with local schools social service organizations and grassroots groups to boost young people&apos;s leadership skills and build networks to advance opportunities. At the IAF we support community-led solutions to enhance peace and security in Colombia. Proyectarte&apos;s activities strengthen grassroots organizations through education and training and build peer-to-peer learning and action networks. Amendment FY22:This amendment provides Proyectarte with an additional 36 months and $200,000 to enable IAF-funded participants to replicate what they have learned with new participants in additional communities and expands Proyectarte?s work in three comunas, or urban neighborhoods of Medellin. Proyectarte will strengthen its support for young people?s leadership skills and incorporate teacher training, so that teachers can apply Proyectarte?s methodologies in their classrooms. As part of the amendment, Proyectarte is mobilizing an additional $463,664 in counterpart resources to the grant agreement. This grant is part of our broader initiative that supports grassroots organizations to build a just and lasting peace in Colombia.</narrative>
  </description>
